        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As an independent contractor for FedEx, we provide last-mile delivery service, bridging the gap between FedEx and the final delivery recipients.",
        "start_character": 9253,
        "end_character": 9397
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-021557",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-021557-288bfb848c4dfadd",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-021557",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Furthermore, we do not warrant that the developed ROUTE X platform, upgraded software, regionally adapted deliverables or other R&D products will be promptly launched and integrated into our actual business operations.",
        "start_character": 30105,
        "end_character": 30323
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-021557",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-021557-288bfb848c4dfadd",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-021557",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our designated service area, where we provide exclusive pickup and delivery services to our customer, spans approximately 1,665.28 square miles.",
        "start_character": 5771,
        "end_character": 5915
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-021557",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-021557-288bfb848c4dfadd",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-021557",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The material terms of the current agreement include the following: (i) we agree to provide package pickup and delivery services to FedEx with our own vehicles and our own employees, and we retain exclusive authority to determine the best means to meet the expectations and demands of shippers and recipients, including complete discretion over and responsibility for route design, delivery sequence, type and number of equipment, and staffing and personnel decisions, consistent with other terms of the agreement;",
        "start_character": 9651,
        "end_character": 10164
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-021557",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-021557-288bfb848c4dfadd",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-021557",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Through our wholly owned subsidiary, JAR Transportation Inc, a California-based operating entity, we specialize in last-mile delivery services within California.",
        "start_character": 77,
        "end_character": 238
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-021557",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-021557-288bfb848c4dfadd",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-021557",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have engaged third-party service providers to perform development, upgrade, regional adaptation and other research and development (“R&D”) work for the APP, with our agreements stipulating that all deliverables generated from such services will vest in us exclusively upon full payment, and that the third parties shall indemnify us for any third-party IP infringement claims related to the deliverables.",
        "start_character": 28060,
        "end_character": 28467
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-021557",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-021557-288bfb848c4dfadd",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-021557",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have partnered with a third-party developer to create an interactive app platform that connects third-party drivers with merchants seeking route delivery services.",
        "start_character": 23302,
        "end_character": 23468
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-021557",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-021557-288bfb848c4dfadd",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-021557",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We provide exclusive pickup and delivery services within our designated service area, covering approximately 1,665.28 square miles.",
        "start_character": 717,
        "end_character": 848
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-021557",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-021557-288bfb848c4dfadd",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-021557",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Additionally, we are required to establish and maintain clear and accessible mechanisms for consumers to submit CCPA requests and provide consent.",
        "start_character": 43703,
        "end_character": 43849
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-021557",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-021557-288bfb848c4dfadd",
